title Kaasu on Railway: one-click self-host (one project per shop)
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

GitHub [icon: github, color: "#14171A", label: "GitHub repo"]
Customers [icon: smartphone, color: "#5B6168", label: "Customers"]
Forwarders [icon: android, color: "#E8A33D", label: "Forwarder apps"]
Merchant laptop [icon: user, color: "#14171A", label: "Merchant laptop"]

Railway project [icon: railway, color: "#7C3AED", label: "Railway project: kaasu-shop"] {
  Edge [icon: globe, color: "#3FC59A", label: "Railway edge (auto TLS)"] {
    Pay domain [icon: globe, color: "#3FC59A", label: "pay domain :443"]
    Ingest domain [icon: lock, color: "#E8A33D", label: "ingest domain :8443"]
  }
  Production [icon: server, color: "#0F7B5F", label: "production"] {
    Tailscale [icon: shield, color: "#14171A", label: "Tailscale service"]
    Kaasu service [icon: server, color: "#0F7B5F", label: "Kaasu (Go, 1 replica)"]
    Variables [icon: key, color: "#B42318", label: "Sealed vars"]
    Volume [icon: hard-drive, color: "#14171A", label: "Volume /data"]
    Cron [icon: clock, color: "#9A5410", label: "Restore test"]
  }
  Bucket [icon: archive, color: "#5B6168", label: "Railway Bucket"]
}

Push [icon: bell, color: "#E8A33D", label: "FCM / APNs"]
Shop backend [icon: shopping-cart, color: "#14171A", label: "Shop backend"]
Mailbox [icon: mail, color: "#5B6168", label: "Bank-alert inbox"]
Merchant phone [icon: smartphone, color: "#14171A", label: "Merchant phone"]

GitHub > Production: deploy
Customers > Pay domain
Forwarders > Ingest domain: signed alerts
Merchant laptop > Tailscale: admin
Tailscale > Kaasu service: private :9000
Edge > Kaasu service
Variables > Kaasu service
Kaasu service > Volume
Volume > Bucket: Litestream
Cron > Bucket
Kaasu service > Push
Kaasu service > Shop backend: webhooks
Kaasu service > Mailbox: IMAP
Push > Merchant phone: voice alert
